      "reading_order": 6,
      "text": "3.2.2. Promotion of MICE in Uttar Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_6_block_006",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 284.0,
        "y1": 1488.0,
        "x2": 2196.0,
        "y2": 1686.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9423335194587708,
      "reading_order": 7,
      "text": "The **Uttar Pradesh State Tourism Policy 2016** recognizes the importance of MICE Tourism as an\nengine to drive growth. The cities of Noida, Agra, Lucknow and Varanasi have been identified for\npromoting MICE in the state. The department of tourism will take the following initiatives-"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_6_block_007",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 343.0,
        "y1": 1729.0,
        "x2": 2195.0,
        "y2": 1920.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9412506222724915,
      "reading_order": 8,
      "text": "i. In collaboration with private entrepreneurs, Convention centres will be established for trade\nfairs, seminars, exhibitions etc. in Noida, Agra, Lucknow and Varanasi which are ideal tourism\ncentres for MICE tourism in Uttar Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_6_block_008",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 346.0,
        "y1": 1966.0,
        "x2": 2034.0,
        "y2": 2022.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.865734338760376,
      "reading_order": 9,
      "text": "ii. Private entrepreneurs will be provided land on a high priority to invest in Conventions"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_6_block_009",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 346.0,
        "y1": 2071.0,
        "x2": 2194.0,
        "y2": 2193.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9231085777282715,
      "reading_order": 10,
      "text": "iii. The new Convention Centres being constructed will be provided rebates in taxes for the first\nfive years of business"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_6_block_010",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 344.0,
        "y1": 2241.0,
        "x2": 1769.0,
        "y2": 2297.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.8703299164772034,
      "reading_order": 11,
      "text": "iv. The MICE facilities in the state will be widely promoted and publicized"
    },
